    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- in index.html, change the page title to \"AI Vocabulary Flashcards\"\r\n- in style.css, add a new CSS rule for a class named `.highlight` that sets the text color to purple\r\n- in index.html, add a new flashcard div, giving it the class `flashcard`\r\n- in the new flashcard, add a term and its definition for the word \"Algorithm\", using `h3` for the term and `p` for the definition\r\n- in style.css, add a hover effect to `.flashcard` so that the `.definition` becomes visible when the flashcard is hovered over\r\n- in index.html, apply the `.highlight` class to the term \"Feature\" in the first flashcard",
